@startuml breadpan-input-routing
participant 消费方
participant breadpan
participant "Item" as item

消费方 -> breadpan: 语义输入方法
breadpan -> breadpan: 内部处理（校验与路由）
breadpan -> item: Activate / SecondaryActivate / ContextMenu / Scroll / dbusmenu Event
item --> breadpan: 应答（VOID 送达）
breadpan --> 消费方: InteractionOutcome / 回执事件 / 错误
@enduml
